{
  "id": "clash-at-the-summit-launch-tournament",
  "name": "Clash at the Summit launch tournament",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The tournaments held to launch Clash at the Summit (頂上大激突), the last expansion of the LEGEND series, released on 8 July 2010. From that day Gym Challenge (ジム☆チャレンジ) shops of the official Pokémon Card Gym network held launch tournaments in two leagues, one for elementary school children and younger and an open one, where every player got Electabuzz 069/L-P with a holo basic Energy and the top three got Indigo Plateau 070/L-P with original card goods and a gold Jirachi coin. Pokémon Challenge Hiroba events and Pokémon Centers held launch battles too, with the same two cards, both carrying the LEGEND and Clash at the Summit logos on their pictures.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 「頂上大激突」発売記念大会 7月「ジム☆チャレンジ」【2010】",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/promo_event/clash-at-the-summit-release-tournament-gym-challenge-in-july-2010/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Japan Official Pokemon Card Gym Events 2008 – 2009",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/japan-official-pokemon-card-gym-events-2008-2009/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 070/L-P セキエイこうげん： 「頂上大激突」発売記念大会 上位入賞者",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/070lp-indigoplateau-promo/"
      }
    ]
  },
